  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-09T07:12:20.027Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think a really neat feature to have would be the ability for the instance creator to change the instance type (friends+, Invite only, ect...) on the fly without having to drop a new portal or make everyone change worlds.",
